  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/02/IMG_1794.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Cena de San Valent&iacute;n en Campus Espai d&#39;Oci, con m&uacute;sica de un d&uacute;o&nbsp;a los postres, Arturo Roger, exDJ de la m&iacute;tica ACTV en la Malvarrosa de Valencia,&nbsp;en la sala 1, y Almorranes Garrapinyaes y La Gran Chingada en la sala 2 de GROW Club Events. Una celebraci&oacute;n de lo m&aacute;s variada sin salir de la plaza Siglo XXI de Onda.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanvalentincampusygrow/img_1794.jpg\" alt=\"img_1794\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanvalentincampusygrow/img_1795.jpg\" alt=\"img_1795\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanvalentincampusygrow/img_1796.jpg\" alt=\"img_1796\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanvalentincampusygrow/img_1799.jpg\" alt=\"img_1799\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanvalentincampusygrow/img_1800.jpg\" alt=\"img_1800\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanvalentincampusygrow/img_1801.jpg\" alt=\"img_1801\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanvalentincampusygrow/img_1802.jpg\" alt=\"img_1802\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanvalentincampusygrow/img_1803.jpg\" alt=\"img_1803\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanvalentincampusygrow/img_1804.jpg\" alt=\"img_